# Count cards

Every count card (a card that surfaces a single metric: a label + a big number, optionally with a delta, icon, description, or sparkline) must use the shared component:

```
src/components/CountCard.jsx
```

This is the canonical design, taken from the Site Health overview count strip. Do not hand-roll a new count-card layout, and do not fork these styles into a page.

## Fixed typography — never change

The point of `CountCard` is consistency. These are locked and must not be overridden per usage:

- **Label** — `text-[13px] font-medium text-gray-500` (medium weight, never semibold/bold, never uppercase/tracking-wide).
- **Value** — `text-[16px] font-semibold text-gray-900`.
- **Delta pill** — 12px reference pill: green (`--success-100` bg / `#15803D` text) for up, red (`#FEE2E2` bg / `#DC2626` text) for down, with an `ArrowUp` that rotates 180° when down.
- **Padding** — `px-3 py-2.5` (compact; do not reintroduce taller padding / large bold values).

Prefer `help` + `helpContent` for explanatory copy (info icon next to the title) instead of a visible `description` line under the value.

Do not introduce 18px+ / bold values, or bold labels. If a design shows a different size, still use the CountCard sizes.

## Usage

```jsx
import CountCard from '../CountCard.jsx' // adjust relative depth

// Plain (reference)
<CountCard label="Pages crawled" value="1,000" delta={1.6} deltaUp />

// With an icon (top-right tinted box)
<CountCard label="Images" value="4" Icon={FileText} iconColor="var(--primary-600)" />

// With a help tooltip, description, or a footer sparkline
<CountCard label="Brand presence" value="418" delta="8.2%" description="vs previous period"
  Icon={Award} iconColor="#6938EF" footer={<Sparkline data={data} color="#6938EF" width="100%" height={56} filled />} />
```

### Props
- `label`, `value` — required.
- `delta` + `deltaUp` — short delta rendered as the reference pill (e.g. `"1.6%"`, `8.2`).
- `changeText` + `changeUp` — descriptive change line (arrow + coloured text) when the copy is longer than a pill (e.g. `"+6 vs prior period"`).
- `description` — muted sub-line under the value.
- `Icon` + `iconColor` — optional icon in a top-right tinted box (`iconColor` is a CSS colour, e.g. `var(--primary-600)` or `#6938EF`).
- `help` — show a `HelpCircle` beside the label.
- `footer` — optional node pinned below (e.g. a sparkline).

## Keep vs strip
- Keep existing extras (icon, description, change text, sparkline) by passing them as props — do not delete them.
- But route them through `CountCard` so the label weight, value size, and delta pill stay identical everywhere.

## Do not
- Do not build a count card with raw `<div>` + inline label/value markup.
- Do not change the font sizes or make the label semibold/bold.
- Do not use `uppercase` / `tracking-wide` on the label.
